docs/reviews/2026-11-18-whole-range/kickoff-fix-f5.md:6:`scripts/cron-setup-hetzner.sh` installs the entry watchdog as `*/15 10-23 * * *`: it runs from 10:00 to 23:45 ET. The command itself checks only from 75 minutes before the pick's earliest first pitch until the submission cutoff (first pitch minus 5). A pick whose earliest game starts before 11:15 ET gets fewer checks than the window allows, and one that starts before 10:05 gets none: for a 06:10 opener (delivered at 05:10) the first run is 10:00, 230 minutes after first pitch; nothing checks the entry before the pitch, and the next morning `bts day-outcome` pages ENTRY UNVERIFIABLE even when the entry was right.
